Subject: [PATCH 13/49] =?UTF-8?q?arm64/rk3576:=20=E4=BF=AE=E6=AD=A3?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E7=94=B5=E6=BA=90=E5=9F=9F=E7=BC=96=E5=8F=B7=E4=B8=8E=E6=AF=8F?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=9F=9F=E7=9A=84=20req=20=E5=81=8F=E7=A7=BB?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
